#: ../../source/index.rst:2
msgid "Daedalus Studio User Guide"
msgstr "Daedalus Studio 用户指南"

#: ../../source/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"Daedalus Studio is a Windows desktop workbench for building Godot "
"projects with an AI agent. It keeps the conversation, project context, "
"tool activity, approvals, file changes, and verification results together"
" so that you can review what happened before you keep the change."
msgstr ""
"Daedalus Studio 是一款用于借助 AI agent 开发 Godot 项目的 Windows "
"桌面工作台。它会集中记录对话、项目上下文、工具活动、审批、文件变更和验证结果，让你在保留变更前能够检查整个过程。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:9
msgid ""
"This guide is written for people using Studio, not for contributors "
"maintaining its source code. Start with :doc:`getting-started/index` if "
"you have not installed Studio yet. If you are already working in a "
"project, go to :doc:`workspaces/index` or :doc:`agent/index`."
msgstr ""
"本指南面向 Studio 使用者，而不是维护源代码的贡献者。如果你还没有安装 Studio，请从 :doc:`getting-"
"started/index` 开始。如果你已经在项目中工作，可以前往 :doc:`workspaces/index` 或 "
":doc:`agent/index`。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:16
msgid ""
"Daedalus Studio, Daedalus Backend, and the Godot Daedalus editor plugin "
"are released as a coordinated set. Studio normally manages the backend "
"and plugin versions for you. Do not mix components from unrelated "
"releases unless you are deliberately testing an integration."
msgstr ""
"Daedalus Studio、Daedalus Backend 和 Godot Daedalus 编辑器插件作为一组协同组件发布。通常由 "
"Studio 为你管理后端和插件版本。除非你是在有意测试集成，否则不要混用不相关版本中的组件。"

